  "reviewed_requirements": [
    {
      "requirement": "Closed old16 and new17 wire; full profile8 and exact descriptor4",
      "finding": "Clear from source. saved() distinguishes descriptor absence from explicit null/empty, validates complete local keys, then known14. New descriptor requires String API, TYPE_INT schema1, exact canonical eight-field typed profile and one of two recipe Strings. Outer/world versions and sequence7 are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "requirement": "Legacy numeric acceptance preserved",
      "finding": "Clear from source. Legacy selection returns before new exact descriptor/Scheduler-profile comparisons. Original native validators and Codec.is_integer/is_number calls remain; vector expectation only substitutes the same immutable original Vector3 map. The existing Codec.value_error already excludes StringName, so the new profile-id String check does not narrow its accepted JSON domain."
    },
    {
      "requirement": "Saved compatibility distinct from fresh mapping",
      "finding": "Clear from source. Fresh Challenge chooses exchanged; saved canonical Challenge is valid. Literal old16 always uses original roots and recaptures old16. Saved entry calls saved(local), with no preference query or fresh() call."
    },
    {
      "requirement": "Finite immutable whole nine-root map",
      "finding": "Clear from source. _selection deep-copies Sequence.ACTORS, swaps only putney_scout/putney_handler XZ and retains each native Y. No arbitrary vectors are serialized. Receipt, positions, profile and descriptor/profile are made read-only before native assembly."
    },
    {
      "requirement": "Selection before native ready/configure/bind",
      "finding": "Clear from source. Original London _ready is byte-identical and builds map-independent fixed floor/Kit only. London overrides inherited actor constructors. _l4_construct checks one-use custody, freezes selection, begins actual Scheduler and joins its exact profile before first actor. Each selected root is assigned before add_child invokes actor _ready and before sole configure."
    },
    {
      "requirement": "One map for art, target, geometry, snapshot and custody",
      "finding": "Clear from source. Actor-owned native rig is created under the preselected root; inherited native actor configure latches that root. Handler tool geometry/opening and cues derive from actual selected actor. Ray bindings use actual actors. Both bank opening paths, native tool anchor preflight, known target roots and passive actor custody use the same map. Floor/scenery/witness/artilleryman inputs contain no actor-map dependency."
    },
    {
      "requirement": "Retained descriptor after empty ended Scheduler",
